they  can  serve  the  Lord  at  home  as  well  in  private.  How  many  are  apt  to  say, 
they  see  not  but  their  time  may  be  as  well  spent  at  home,  in  praying,  reading  some 
good  book,  or  discoursing  on  some  profitable  subject,  as  in  the  use  of  ordinances 
